  "observations": [
    "Every stage of the plan's Definition of Done ran on a genuine upload with no GPU worker: analysis, Song Model, brain candidates, selection, mix plan, revision, approval, export.",
    "Tempo, meter and sections came from the PR-32 local fallback and are stamped low_confidence with LOCAL_SIGNAL_ANALYZER_V1 as provider; no chord or melody provider ran locally, so the Song Model carries no chords and no melody -- the Brain arranged from tempo, energy and sections alone. That is the honest floor of a local install.",
    "The sketch alone did not clear the arrangement gate (model confidence below MIN_ARRANGEMENT_CONFIDENCE 0.55). The product path is the Song Model editor: the producer corrected the tempo (99.2 -> 100), confirmed the assumed 4/4 and re-cut the form; verified fields became authoritative (confidence 1), the beat/bar grid was re-derived on the canonical timeline, and the recomputed model confidence cleared the gate. The provider sketch remains in provenance.",
    "Stems from the reference synth are preview-only unless the VST3 worker is running; the mastered export is measured by the BS.1770 meter regardless.",
    "Nobody listened. Gate C is unchanged."
